      "text": "Fig. 16, ‘Age population pyramid by World Bank income group in 2024, expressed as population size in 1000s by income group’ (Source: UN World Population Prospects 2024). A horizontal stacked bar chart plotting five-year age cohorts from 0–4 up to 100+ against population size in thousands (0 to 350 000 on each side), disaggregated into Low-income, Lower-middle-income, Upper-middle-income, and High-income countries (World Bank FY 2026 classification).",
